        "en": "Warm and dedicated veterinary practitioners"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet owners consistently praise Dr. Benjamin, Dr. Krieger, and front office receptionist Brandi for their personable and empathetic approach. Reviewers note that staff remember pet names, offer sincere comfort during stressful appointments, and treat patients like family."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "communication",
      "sentiment": "mixed",
      "mentions": 13,
      "title": {
        "en": "Clear consultations with isolated desk issues"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "The majority of clients value step-by-step guidance and detailed breakdowns of medical options from attending veterinarians. A few reviewers, however, recount administrative frustration over dropped phone records and unconfirmed appointment bookings."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "waiting",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 12,
      "title": {
        "en": "Prompt visits and flexible scheduling"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients frequently highlight prompt check-ins, minimal lobby waiting times, and the ability to secure same-day appointments for acute ailments. Reviewers also appreciate the availability of weekend appointment slots and efficient routine wellness visits."
      }
    }
  ],
